<title>USA: W.W. Grainger signs deal with Mercedes-Benz.</title>
<headline>W.W. Grainger signs deal with Mercedes-Benz.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.W. Grainger Inc said Monday it has received a three-year integrated supply contract from Mercedes-Benz U.S. International Inc, a subsidiary of Daimler-Benz AG.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the contract, W.W. Grainger, an industrial supply distributor, said its Grainger Integrated Supply Operations unit will administer central storeroom operations, including receiving, distribution, product replenishment, and inventory management, for a Mercedes-Benz plant in Vance, Ala.</p>
</text>
